# annotation-of exposes @Expr return annotation as the string "Expr" (S-933, T-1790)
# This verifies that functions annotated with @Expr (not @[return: Expr])
# correctly expose their return annotation through the annotation-of builtin.
[f: [fn@Expr [let x] x]]
[ann: [annotation-of f]]
[result: [= ann.return "Expr"]]
=== out
Dict({"result": Variant(Boolean.True, Null)})
